@startuml Benchmark_Sequence_Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20

actor User #lightgreen
participant "Orchestrator" as Orchestrator #lightyellow
participant "Benchmark\nRunner" as BenchmarkRunner #lightblue
participant "Main Node" as MainNode #lavender
participant "RabbitMQ" as RabbitMQ #wheat
participant "Worker" as Worker #lightcyan
participant "Analyzer" as Analyzer #pink

title BRISE Benchmark - High-Level Flow

== 1. Initialization ==
User -> Orchestrator: **Start Benchmark**\n//./init.sh up benchmark//
activate Orchestrator
Orchestrator -> BenchmarkRunner: run_benchmark()
activate BenchmarkRunner

== 2. Execute Experiments ==
loop For each experiment

    BenchmarkRunner ->> MainNode: **Start Experiment** (sync)\n//perform_experiment()//
    activate MainNode
    MainNode -->> BenchmarkRunner: ✓ Acknowledged\n//{'status': 'running'}//
    note right of MainNode: Synchronous:\nRequest-Response

    loop Optimization iterations
        MainNode -> MainNode: **Select configurations**\n//ConfigurationSelection//
        MainNode ->> Worker: **Execute tasks** (async)\n//task_queue//
        activate Worker
        note right of Worker: Asynchronous:\nEvent-driven
        Worker -> Worker: **Run experiments**\n//worker_method()//
        Worker -->> MainNode: **Task results**\n//task_result_exchange//
        deactivate Worker
        MainNode -> MainNode: **Update model**\n//add_configuration()//
    end

    MainNode -->> BenchmarkRunner: **Experiment complete** (async)\n//final_event()//
    note left: Async notification\nwhen done

    BenchmarkRunner ->> MainNode: **Download results** (sync)\n//download_latest_dump()//
    MainNode -->> BenchmarkRunner: ✓ Results file\n//experiment.pkl//
    deactivate MainNode
    BenchmarkRunner -> BenchmarkRunner: **Store results**\n//./results/serialized///

end

BenchmarkRunner ->> MainNode: **Stop** (sync)\n//stop_main()//
activate MainNode
MainNode -->> BenchmarkRunner: ✓ Stopped
deactivate MainNode
deactivate BenchmarkRunner

== 3. Analysis ==
Orchestrator -> Analyzer: **Analyze results**\n//poc_analyzer_main()//
activate Analyzer
Analyzer -> Analyzer: **Load experiment data**\n//load dumps//
Analyzer -> Analyzer: **Generate plots & report**\n//create visualizations//
Analyzer -> User: **Open HTML report**\n//benchmark_poc.html//
deactivate Analyzer
deactivate Orchestrator

@enduml

